        {
          "id": "vnxrwmtzkb99",
          "status": "in_progress",
          "body": "Started: 2026-08-24 05:30 UTC\nEnd time: 2026-08-24 12:00 UTC (extended from 11:00 UTC)\n\nThe scheduled maintenance being performed by our Storage Engineering team on the Spaces service is progressing as planned.\n\nThe maintenance in the SGP1 region has been completed successfully. Work and post-upgrade validation are still in progress in the LON1 and SYD1 regions, and approximately one additional hour is required to complete the remaining work.\n\nWe are therefore extending the maintenance window from 11:00 UTC to 12:00 UTC.\n\nExpected Impact:\n\nThe maintenance remains low-impact. Customers may continue to experience brief network interruptions or momentary delays when accessing Spaces in the affected regions while the remaining work is completed. Service will resume normal operation automatically once the maintenance concludes, and no action is required.\n\nWe will provide another update once the maintenance is fully completed.",
